00:03:32,240 --> 00:03:33,790
I'll remember this name.

23
00:03:37,640 --> 00:03:38,670
Named Xu ?

24
00:03:39,400 --> 00:03:40,590
You also thought of it...

25
00:03:42,320 --> 00:03:44,310
For such a powerful Corporeal Yang cultivator to appear,

26
00:03:44,480 --> 00:03:46,790
it has to be the Xu Family of Planet Dong Lin.

27
00:03:47,960 --> 00:03:48,950
Could this person be...

28
