31
00:03:58,840 --> 00:04:00,150
But Uncle Ping and the others...

32
00:04:00,760 --> 00:04:02,550
They acted recklessly.

33
00:04:03,720 --> 00:04:05,360
Since they're dead, they're dead.

34
00:04:06,520 --> 00:04:07,230
Understood.

35
00:04:12,600 --> 00:04:15,720
Inside the Celestial Cave

36
00:04:12,920 --> 00:04:13,870
Brother Xu,

37
00:04:14,080 --> 00:04:16,910
this cave seems somewhat peculiar.

38
00:04:18,480 --> 00:04:19,190
Look,

39
00:04:19,720 --> 00:04:20,950
