41
00:04:23,920 --> 00:04:26,230
It must have been isolated from the outside for very long.

42
00:04:28,200 --> 00:04:29,990
Since this place was left by Celestials,

43
00:04:31,000 --> 00:04:32,630
it's strange that no one visited it

44
00:04:33,080 --> 00:04:34,190
before us.

45
00:04:42,400 --> 00:04:44,230
We have been moving at full speed

46
00:04:44,640 --> 00:04:46,110
for half an hour now.

47
00:04:46,680 --> 00:04:48,030
Why haven't we reached the end yet ?

48
00:04:49,400 --> 00:04:51,150
Just how deep is this tunnel ?

49
00:04:52,960 --> 00:04:54,150
Something's wrong.

50
00:04:58,880 --> 00:04:59,350
Brother Xu,

51
00:04:59,480 --> 00:05:00,070
