52
00:05:00,920 --> 00:05:02,430
Do you sense anything unusual ?

53
00:05:03,120 --> 00:05:04,390
What do you mean, Brother Xu ?

54
00:05:05,320 --> 00:05:06,510
Since we entered,

55
00:05:07,040 --> 00:05:08,910
I have been using my Divine Sense to probe the path ahead

56
00:05:09,400 --> 00:05:10,350
and mark our way back.

57
00:05:11,720 --> 00:05:12,510
But I discovered

58
00:05:13,720 --> 00:05:15,030
