62
00:05:23,520 --> 00:05:26,190
This rune is a type of celestial restriction.

63
00:05:26,520 --> 00:05:27,310
It's extremely rare

64
00:05:27,680 --> 00:05:28,950
and can't be used by itself.

65
00:05:29,440 --> 00:05:31,790
It needs to be combined with other runes

66
00:05:32,000 --> 00:05:33,750
