74
00:05:53,600 --> 00:05:54,710
what formation it is.

75
00:05:55,520 --> 00:05:57,550
The Celestial Realm has been shattered for so long

76
00:05:57,840 --> 00:05:59,950
but this place still has an active formation ?

77
00:06:00,920 --> 00:06:02,190
Whatever is at the end

78
00:06:02,880 --> 00:06:03,900
is either a great treasure

79
00:06:04,560 --> 00:06:05,710
or a great calamity.

80
00:06:06,440 --> 00:06:08,390
But this is too rare of an opportunity...

81
00:06:09,200 --> 00:06:10,590
Giving up now

82
00:06:11,440 --> 00:06:12,430
would be a waste.

83
00:06:14,560 --> 00:06:15,190
Brother Li,

84
00:06:16,080 --> 00:06:16,870
in that case,

85
00:06:17,320 --> 00:06:18,510
