161
00:09:56,920 --> 00:10:00,080
Wasteland
Thunder Celestial Realm

162
00:10:01,480 --> 00:10:02,230
Brother Xu !

163
00:10:12,320 --> 00:10:12,870
Brother Li,

164
00:10:13,040 --> 00:10:13,830
